--- stderr
warning: chant audit under the current directory changes in the next release (chant#2527):
  before/.gitlab-ci.yml is git-ignored. Every walker skips git-ignored files from the next release. To keep reading it after the change, add "before/.gitlab-ci.yml" to include in chant.config.ts, which the next release honours.
